DTSTAMP:20260901T124109Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260915
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260916
SUMMARY:Deadline: Monson Arts Residency: Winter 2027
DESCRIPTION:Monson Arts hosts residencies for artists and writers in Monson
 \, Maine\, providing housing\, all meals\, private studios\, and a USD 500
  stipend (USD 250 for two-week stays). The application window for Winter 2
 027 runs 1 August to 15 September 2026.\n\nOrganisation: Monson Arts\nLoca
 tion: Monson\, Maine\, United States. No citizenship restriction stated.\n
 Award: USD 500 stipend (USD 250 for two-week stays)\, plus housing\, all m
 eals\, and a private studio. No fee mentioned.\nDuration: Winter 2027 resi
 dencies\; application window 1 August to 15 September 2026.\n\nMore: https
 ://monsonarts.org/residencies/overview/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantd
 esk&utm_medium=referral
